#   ✓ googletest (1.15.2) - C++ testing framework (updated from 1.14.0)
#   ✓ google_benchmark (1.9.0) - C++ microbenchmarking (updated from 1.8.3)
#   ✓ re2 (2024-07-02) - Regular expression library (updated from 2023-09-01)
